	  Notes: The Server supports the collection of diagnostic information and exposes it in the AddressSpace. This includes always the ServerDiagnostics Object of the Server Object and its EnabledFlag Variable. The EnabledFlag in the ServerDiagnostics Object can be set TRUE and in that case the following Objects and Variables for diagnostic data as defined in the ServerDiagnosticsType are exposed: ServerDiagnosticsSummary with all its subcomponents, SubscriptionDiagnosticsArray, and SessionsDiagnosticsSummary with all its subcomponents.

